## About this reference

Shortcuts listed here come from **`AppCommandDescriptor.shortcut`** in the Cardmaniacs app command catalog—the authoritative source for default macOS bindings. Commands with `shortcut: nil` are available from the **Command palette** (`⌘K`) or **Actions palette** (`⌘⇧A`) only.

{% note %}
Unless marked otherwise, shortcuts are **macOS defaults**. iOS and iPadOS use touch and external-keyboard mappings where supported; many palette-only commands have no hardware shortcut on mobile.
{% /note %}

Custom rebinding may be available in the **Help → Keyboard Shortcuts** (`⌘/`) reference on macOS.

